---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="AI-Supported Content Operations for Nonprofits & GovCon | Guiding Point Consulting"
  description="AI content operations that keep your voice human. Templates, SOPs, and guardrails for nonprofits and government contractors — built for your team."
>
  <style>
    .hero-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 64px;
  align-items: center;
}
    .hero-image {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      border-radius: 4px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(50,52,90,0.12);
      display: block;
    }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 32px;
      }
      .hero-image-wrap {
        order: -1;
      }
    }
  </style>

  <main>
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="service-hero container">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-text">
          <span class="eyebrow">AI Content Operations</span>
          <h1>AI-Supported Content Operations</h1>
          <p class="service-intro">
            Your team is already stretched thin — updates, reports, board materials, outreach, all
            competing for the same few hours. AI can take real weight off that load, but only if it's
            set up to support your voice, not replace it.
          </p>
          <p class="service-intro">
            Guiding Point Consulting builds <strong>AI-supported content workflows for nonprofits
            and government contractors</strong> that move content faster without losing the human
            judgment, compliance awareness, and mission voice that your organization can't afford to lose.
          </p>
          <p class="service-intro">
            We believe AI adoption done carelessly erodes the human connection that makes your
            organization trustworthy in the first place. Done right, it protects that connection by
            freeing your people to spend more time on it — not less.
          </p>
          <div class="cta-group" style="justify-content: flex-start;">
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Build Your AI Content System</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-image-wrap">
          <img
            src="/images/ai-content-operations-page.webp"
            alt="Workflow diagram showing strategy, productivity, planning, and team collaboration"
            class="hero-image"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What You Get -->
    <section class="service-section container">
      <h2>What You Get</h2>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>Templates, SOPs, and structured workflows for the content your team produces most: updates, reports, board materials, outreach, and program communications</li>
        <li>Prompt kits and guardrails tailored to your voice, your compliance needs, and your values — so AI output sounds like you, not like a chatbot</li>
        <li>Simple governance: who can use which tools, for what purpose, and how content gets reviewed before it goes live</li>
        <li>Optional next step: AI trained on your own content and documents, so it can answer common questions for clients, residents, or supporters in your actual voice</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Who This Is For -->
    <section class="service-section container">
      <h2>Who This Is For</h2>
      <div class="audience-grid">
        <div class="audience-card">
          <p><strong>Nonprofits</strong> whose small comms team needs to produce more content without burning out or losing quality control</p>
        </div>
        <div class="audience-card">
          <p><strong>Government prime contractors</strong> who need AI content workflows that meet compliance and brand-voice requirements for the organizations they serve</p>
        </div>
        <div class="audience-card">
          <p>Any mission-driven team that's curious about AI but wary of losing what makes their communication feel human and trustworthy</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="not-this-box">
        <p><strong>What this is not:</strong> This isn't "install ChatGPT and hope for the best." It's a structured system — with real guardrails — built around how your team actually works.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Outcome -->
    <section class="service-section container">
      <div class="outcome-box">
        <h2>The Outcome</h2>
        <p>Content moves faster, with fewer bottlenecks, and your team spends less time on repetitive drafting and more time on the judgment calls that actually need a human.</p>
      </div>

    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="service-cta container">
      <h2>Ready to Make AI Work for Your Team?</h2>
      <p>Let's build a content system that moves faster without losing what makes your organization trustworthy.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Build Your AI Content System</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>